From 7f4289373158cdccb453364bfb7071fb22672b40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:18:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] R6 round 1 (IK6j): recorder children get a short
 environment, worker id replaces hostname, sweep keeps a live owner

MED-1 browser, encoder and probes start with PATH, HOME, LANG, TMPDIR only.
MED-2 RENDER_WORKER_ID (env schema and manifest); dead holders freed only under the same id, none set frees nothing early.
LOW-1 the leftovers sweep never stops or removes a live owner's folder, whatever its age.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VNvA3zNK8bJENArUhDXHfa
